{"id":"7529401e9504af9b","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-universal-property.md","title":"Initial Universal Property","display":"df-universal-property — Initial Universal Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-universal-property","aliases":["58-df-universal-property"],"display":"df-universal-property — Initial Universal Property","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-universal-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-universal-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-property — Initial Universal Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-universal-property-—-Universal-Property\">df-universal-property — Universal Property</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=(O,M,s,t,\\circ,e)\\in V\\land P\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C=(O,M,s,t,\\circ,e)\\in V\\land P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Initial}_{\\mathcal C}\\subseteq O\">\\(\\mathrm{Initial}_{\\mathcal C}\\subseteq O\\)</span> (initial-object predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{Initial}_{\\mathcal C}(P) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land P\\in O\\land\\forall Q\\in O\\;\\exists!u\\in M\\;(s(u)=P\\land t(u)=Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{Initial}_{\\mathcal C}(P) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land P\\in O\\land\\forall Q\\in O\\;\\exists!u\\in M\\;(s(u)=P\\land t(u)=Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A universal property characterizes an object up to unique isomorphism.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-universal-property-—-Universal-Property","text":"df-universal-property — Universal Property","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V$ (category predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=(O,M,s,t,\\circ,e)\\in V\\land P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Initial}_{\\mathcal C}\\subseteq O","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{Initial}_{\\mathcal C}(P) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land P\\in O\\land\\forall Q\\in O\\;\\exists!u\\in M\\;(s(u)=P\\land t(u)=Q)","display":true}],"bytes":854,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1356","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-universal-property.md|58-df-universal-property]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a87b7e1119b63b2c"]}